  "fullName": "Multiset.map",
  "endPos": 1852,
  "detail":
  "```lean\nMultiset.map.{v, u_1} {α : Type u_1} {β : Type v} (f : α → β) (s : Multiset α) : Multiset β\n```\n***\n`map f s` is the lift of the list `map` operation. The multiplicity\nof `b` in `map f s` is the number of `a ∈ s` (counting multiplicity)\nsuch that `f a = b`. \n***\n*import Mathlib.Data.Multiset.Basic*",
  "definitionStartPos": {"line": 1193, "column": 4},
  "definitionPath":
  "/Users/hattoriseiji/Autoinformalization/ExportInfos/./.lake/packages/mathlib//Mathlib/Data/Multiset/Basic.lean",
